WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.570
Flip a coin 5 times. Why isn't it always half heads?

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.360
Short runs can wobble a lot.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:15.010
Flip a thousand times, and the share of heads settles near one half.

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:21.013
Probability describes the long run, not what happens on the next flip.
